y for informational purposes and should not be construed as an offer of services. This site is managed by a RERA authorized real estate agent namely Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited (Registered Agent bearing RERA No: A51700026634).","score":0.9073207,"raw_content":null,"id":"eeda71-04"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/raghav-utopia","title":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon west- Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","content":"Project has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nRaghav Utopia Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2029  \nTarget Possession - December 2028  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nRaghav Utopia project has 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n2BHK - (721 to 732) sqft  \n3BHK - (884 to 908) sqft  \n  \nRaghav Utopia floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 5 flats, 3 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nUtopia Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Raghav Utopia Goregaon West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Raghav Realty Goregaon West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site. [...] Watch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\nWatch All Reels\n\n## Raghav Utopia Overview\n\nLand Parcel\n\n0.19 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\nTowers\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\nFloors\n\nG+4P+17\n\nFloors\n\nConfig\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nConfig\n\nCarpet Area\n\n721-908 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\nRERA NO.\n\nPR1180002501406\n\nRERA NO.\n\nPossession Status\n\nEarly Stage (2-3 yrs)\n\nPossession Status\n\nTarget Possession\n\nDec 2028\n\nTarget Possession\n\nRERA Possession\n\nDec 2029\n\nRERA Possession\n\nLitigation\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Raghav Utopia [...] The all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Raghav Utopia starts from ₹2.75 Cr and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• 884 sq. ft. – ₹2.75 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• 908 sq. ft. – ₹2.78 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across 0.19 acres with 1 towers with G+4P+17 floors. Each floor has 5 flats per floor, 3 lifts, 1 staircases. It is available in 2BHK/3BHK configurations with carpet areas ranging from 721 to 908 sq. ft.","score":0.8803145,"raw_content":null,"id":"84172c-05"}],"response_time":2.48,"request_id":"460f9996-32d8-491e-9537-c8a0b27ee1f5"}